Package: com.catling.wifiawake
Name: wifiawake
Depends: mobilesubstrate | me.lau.ellekit
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Keeps WiFi radio active when the screen is off. Hooks SpringBoard's idle-sleep mechanism and creates IOPMAssertions to prevent the WiFi chip entering PSM. Includes a LaunchDaemon that pings the gateway and applies TCP keep-alive sysctls. Fixes SSH becoming unreachable after a few hours.
Maintainer: Cat-Ling
Author: Cat-Ling
Section: Tweaks
